.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt RDIR_READ 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm rdir_read
.Nd read the next entry in a recursive directory traversal
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In rdir.h
.Ft char *
.Fn rdir_read "rdir_t *d"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn rdir_read
function retrieves the next path entry during a recursive directory traversal initialized by
.Xr rdir_open 3 .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns a pointer to the null-terminated path string of the next entry, or
.Dv NULL
when traversal is complete.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rdir_open 3 ,
.Xr rdir_close 3